mg\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623870/extras/fbf31ce1b7282229e9cbe0654c4187d6.poster.avif?t=1749313186\" width=642 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623870/extras/fbf31ce1b7282229e9cbe0654c4187d6.webm?t=1749313186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3623870/extras/fbf31ce1b7282229e9cbe0654c4187d6.mp4?t=1749313186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Be careful: some actions in the game can define your destiny. Each time you raise your fist against the creatures, you risk becoming one of them. Different paths await you in this story; choose wisely.</p>",
